# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Allowlist model: ignore everything at top level, then re-include only the
# clean-room deliverables. Anything not explicitly un-ignored stays private.
# This guarantees unpacked/ (proprietary), screenshots/ (PII), and local
# session files are never committed, even by `git add -A`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

# Clean-room deliverables (re-included)
!/README.md
!/SPEC.md
!/.gitignore
!/findings
!/tools
!/analysis

# Within analysis/: exclude verbatim/near-verbatim reproductions of the
# target binary and empty/local artifacts.
/analysis/main-strings.txt
/analysis/deviceio-symbols-full.txt
/analysis/bridge-protobuf-messages.raw.txt
/analysis/asar-filelist.txt
/analysis/rea-main-process.md
/analysis/rea-main-process-v2.md
/analysis/rea-preload.md
/analysis/rea-main-process.err
/analysis/rea-main-process-v2.err
/analysis/rea-preload.err
/analysis/package.json
/analysis/blobs/

# Explicitly never publish (also covered by the /* catch-all above)
/unpacked/
/screenshots/
/resume.claude
